島の最高峰であり九州地方および南西諸島の最高峰でもある。","facts":[["標高","1,936 m"],["山系","屋久島"],["所在","鹿児島県"]],"source_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%AE%E4%B9%8B%E6%B5%A6%E5%B2%B3"}],"min_app_version":"2.0.1","title_en":"Mountain","subtitle_en":"100 famous mountains of Japan"}